Package: opengrd
Title: Open, Portable Implementations of Hospital Casemix Groupers
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gabriel", "Maeztu", , "gabriel.maeztu@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Re-implements hospital casemix grouping logic in R so that it can be
    run anywhere, without vendor binaries. Groupers are expressed as published
    logic tables plus a small evaluation engine, starting with the CMS Medicare
    Severity Diagnosis Related Groups (MS-DRG) grouper and, later, the NHS
    England HRG4+ groupers. Inputs and outputs are plain data frames so the
    package composes with the tidyverse and, eventually, with database backends
    through 'dbplyr'.
